# 📊 8-Year Global Sales & Profitability Dashboard (Microsoft Excel)

## 📌 Project Overview
An advanced, interactive **Business Intelligence Dashboard** built entirely in **Microsoft Excel** to analyze **1,000,000 sales transactions** across **185 global locations** over an **8-year period (2010 – 2017)**. 

Because standard Excel worksheets struggle with 1M+ rows, this project leverages **Power Query**, **Power Pivot (Data Model)**, and **Dynamic Form Controls (Radio Buttons)** to allow users to seamlessly switch the entire dashboard's visual context between **Transactions, Orders, Revenue, COGS, and Profit**.

