## 🛠️ Excel Capabilities & Techniques Used
* **Big Data Handling in Excel:** Processed **1,000,000 records** using **Power Query** and **Excel Data Model (Power Pivot)** for high-speed aggregation.
* **Dynamic Metric Switching:** Implemented **Developer Form Controls (Radio/Option Buttons)** linked with lookup formulas (`INDEX/MATCH` & `CHOOSE`) so all charts dynamically update based on the selected KPI (`Transaction`, `Orders`, `Revenue`, `COGS`, or `Profit`).
* **Interactive Slicers:** Multi-select slicers on the left panel for **Country**, **Year (2010–2017)**, and **Quarter (Qtr1–Qtr4)**.
* **Advanced Charting:**
  * Custom Monthly Bar Chart with grouped Quarterly bracket totals (`Q1–Q4`).
  * Donut Gauge Charts for shipping interval breakdown.
  * Treemap for hierarchical product category comparison.
  * Slope/Area Chart for Offline vs. Online channel split.

